{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id558448002"}, "name":{"label":"May as well leave a review"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-04T09:32:31-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12619129718"}, "title":{"label":"Even the base app is brilliant"}, "content":{"label":"Incredibly funny, and genuinely informative. There is a premium option which I haven't opened and frankly the app doesn't need it. It doesn't push you to download it and is still great to interact with just as the base app! Would highly recommend, just be prepared for a weather app more honest than most of your friends would ever dare to be. The weather information is also very accurate and helpfully laid out and explained, so it's a super accessible app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"4"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"4"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id107590932"}, "name":{"label":"Echothesun"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-14T12:31:47-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12543472701"}, "title":{"label":"Outstanding Weather App and a Whole lot of Fun!"}, "content":{"label":"This app offers an insane level of customisation and personalisation. There are multiple layouts, tons of notification settings, widgets, watch complications, data sources (hey even Meteo France is there for holidays). Live activities autostart and are a particular highlight. You can edit and change seemingly anything you want, and it’s clear a huge amount of time and care has been ploughed into the app by the developer. Carrot herself can be pleasant, humorous or damn right insulting and offensive, there’s a great sense of humour throughout.  It’s expensive for the ultra membership, but boy does it deliver! If you nerd out on weather data, or live in a place with a catastrophically bad climate, such as the UK, then this app is a must and an easy recommnedation.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id147852353"}, "name":{"label":"Generalliroh"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-12T02:51:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12533651813"}, "title":{"label":"So good"}, "content":{"label":"Downloaded as I want a weather app that does not sell my data. The layout is great and I love the quirkiness of it. 10/10.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id85711289"}, "name":{"label":"Ghalli"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-10T10:33:37-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.2"}, "id":{"label":"12527153929"}, "title":{"label":"Sul"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been really interested in CARROT Weather because of its features and customization, but the subscription system is extremely misleading. While they advertise multiple subscription tiers, they push the annual plan very aggressively and bury or completely hide the option to subscribe monthly—if it’s even available at all.\n\nI wanted to try out Premium without committing to a full year, but there was no obvious way to do a monthly subscription. It feels like they’ve intentionally designed it this way to lock users into annual payments upfront, which is disappointing for an app that’s otherwise so well-regarded.\n\nIf you value transparency and flexibility, be careful. I expected better from an app with such a strong reputation.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
