{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id33316852"}, "name":{"label":"KimbellyBull"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-12-26T12:05:08-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"12108970772"}, "title":{"label":"Very funny"}, "content":{"label":"Really like this app, it’s really funny when set to overkill and it’s entertaining doing the little missions and achievements, plus the garden. The only downside is the US-centric news/attitude/jokes.\n\nIt would be better if it changed the news to your location and the politics wasn’t entirely USA based. \n\nStill, it’s funny and the weather forecasts seem good.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
