{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id38788818"}, "name":{"label":"Landshark2007"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-09T01:40:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"11929543059"}, "title":{"label":"Weather with a twist"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been a Dark Sky fan since day 1 and it has always been my go to weather app. Now it is part of Apple Weather and, well, you know. So here is Carrot and it is a really different approach to something we all talk about. Its forecasts are customisable and it’s GUI unique. It is part fun, part fact, and totally useable. Set it up the way you like it, and wait for the snark (if that’s your thing). As a non US user (UK) I am still waiting for the weather to prompt some of Carrot’s additional functions (Dynamic Island being the biggest) but so far the UK’s weather has been stable grey for the last few weeks. I’m no fan of subscriptions, but a developer has got to eat and so I stumped up the cash to get more function. I will revisit this review once it am more ‘seasoned’.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id43910303"}, "name":{"label":"anonbuns"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-11-06T22:03:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"11921568895"}, "title":{"label":"my favourite app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using CARROT Weather ever since the first Apple Watch came out, and I’ve been an avid supporter ever since. This app is in my Top-3 of apps for my devices, and when I get a new device, I do not use it until CARROT has finished loading. CARROT has moved cities and countries with me, protected me from the cold and from the heat stroke, and it’s probably the only app I actually feel passionate about.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id104739574"}, "name":{"label":"dannywelshman"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-21T08:06:07-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"11858938378"}, "title":{"label":"Almost perfect"}, "content":{"label":"I like the app very much, it’s full of data, great notifications and lots of fun but the phone widgets are horrific, like really really bad, the colours are not conducive to a nice looking widget , just one single normal looking weather widget would make this app perfect, I’m a premium plus subscriber so think I deserve a better looking widget", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id969480811"}, "name":{"label":"opx.love"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-10-15T11:31:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.1.3"}, "id":{"label":"11837634648"}, "title":{"label":"Greedy and unreliable"}, "content":{"label":"First I paid for the app a few years ago because I liked the cute dialogue that the AI was given and the interface was appeasing. Would I check the weather on (free) weather sites? Yes, because Carrot’s are inaccurate. But still I hung around. Now it seems they’ve removed widgets and put it behind a pay wall. I’ve tried the free trial and the widgets are not working. Im so disappointed. I’ve been held hostage by the overall cute theme behind Carrot for over two years now, but I’ve finally been set free by their own greediness :/", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
