{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1681986938"}, "name":{"label":"#Totallyreal"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-27T09:50:58-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"11659241214"}, "title":{"label":"Best weather app I’ve seen so far"}, "content":{"label":"In my 74 years on doodle farm earth I’ve never looped such a app. My iphonic had the boring bbc weather appt that had none good darn features \nThis one has some personality and more info on the wheather and if you upload premium it got even more goody stuff\nI like that you can charnge the personality from nice to homosapien: so you can change it from nice to human\n*never mind I looked again it’s homoCIDAL does anyone no what that darn diddly means \n**I looked it up it mean murderous that not very nicer\nAll around good app should download", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
