{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id253334944"}, "name":{"label":"apclapp"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2024-08-12T03:37:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.0.3"}, "id":{"label":"11600729605"}, "title":{"label":"Obnoxious Upsell"}, "content":{"label":"You’ve paid for the app, but every single time you open it to check the weather, you are harassed by an “upgrade to premium” full screen dialog that needs to be dismissed. No option to dismiss forever, because that would make less money.\n\nThis app was good, but it has changed into something greedy. There’s multiple tiers of “premium” subscriptions— after you’ve already paid for the app— an app for weather. \n\nFeatures behind subscription tiers are what you would expect any normal weather app to include for free. If this company sold a calculator app they would charge a monthly fee if you wanted to press the number 7. Maybe an extra premium tier to get 3 multiplications per month.\n\nJust sad really. I’d love to know the story behind the progressive demise of this app, my assumption is the general trend of ens**tification that happens to every good thing that’s ever existed.\n\nJust steer clear, I’m sure better things have come out. If you don’t mind being milked for another nonsense subscription, then go ahead, there’s a lot of good things behind all those paywalls.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=961390574&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
